WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.125
Amazon Ads Promotions can help grow your business while reducing advertising costs through earned

00:00:06.125 --> 00:00:07.000
ad credits.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.182
In this video, you'll learn how to redeem spend-based promotions, track your credits, and use them

00:00:13.182 --> 00:00:15.000
effectively to scale your business.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Step 1.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Complete your qualifying action.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.500
Review your offer details carefully.

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Note the offer amount, eligible marketplace, promotion dates, and qualifying action.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:31.478
To qualify, you may need to launch a specific ad format like sponsored TV, then spend a certain

00:00:31.478 --> 00:00:33.000
amount on that ad product.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:34.200
Step 2.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.000
Track your credits.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:40.706
Visit the promotions page in your advertising console to view your current balance and check reward

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:41.000
status.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.684
Earn credits deposit to your account within 14 days of the expiration date listed in the offer progress

00:00:46.684 --> 00:00:47.000
section.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.200
Step 3.

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:50.000
Use your credits.

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Credits apply automatically to future advertising spend and may be exclusive to select ad products.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:01.000
Keep campaigns running to use credits before they expire, usually within 30 days.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:07.182
These credits reduce ad costs and can give your business room to experiment with new ad strategies

00:01:07.182 --> 00:01:09.000
and ultimately reach more customers.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:11.727
Turn cautious steps into confident moves.

00:01:11.727 --> 00:01:14.000
Get started with promotions today.
